# ========== CLIENT / FRONTEND ONLY (Vite — only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser) ==========
# Copy to .env locally. On Vercel (client project): Settings → Environment Variables.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_URL  —  Public URL of your deployed API (the Express server), NO trailing slash
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local dev: leave EMPTY — Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:5000 (see vite.config.ts)
#
# Production (client + API deployed separately): set to your backend origin, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-project.vercel.app
#
# Do NOT put MONGODB_URI here — it would be bundled into the website and leak secrets.
# MongoDB belongs only on the server (server .env / Vercel API project).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

VITE_API_URL=
